    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multiplayer horror escape game for 1 to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two modes: PvE (player vs. enemy) mode and PvP (player vs. layer) mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match takes 10 to 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to escape from the area by completing simple clear conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple monsters roaming in the area and attacking the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE mode: Can be played by one player, and players can cooperate with up to four other players to escape from the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP mode: The game is divided into player and monster sides. The monster side must use their special skills to stop the player from escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The area provides items to help escape, lockers to hide in, and actions such as climbing over walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a private game developer, so I would be very encouraged if you could review my work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also welcome live and video streaming!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multiplayer horror escape game for 1 to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two modes: PvE (player vs. enemy) mode and PvP (player vs. layer) mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match takes 10 to 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to escape from the area by completing simple clear conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple monsters roaming in the area and attacking the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE mode: Can be played by one player, and players can cooperate with up to four other players to escape from the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP mode: The game is divided into player and monster sides. The monster side must use their special skills to stop the player from escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The area provides items to help escape, lockers to hide in, and actions such as climbing over walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a private game developer, so I would be very encouraged if you could review my work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also welcome live and video streaming!</p>",
    "short_description": "A multiplayer horror escape game for one or up to four players, PvE mode allows you and your friends to work together to escape from an area. In PvP mode, you can also play as the monster and prevent players from escaping. Use your special skills to prevent them from escaping!",
